SUMMARY:[Scheduled] Games to play with your friend group after work [TT/IG/
 SC/YT]
DESCRIPTION:Status: Scheduled\nPlatforms: TikTok+Instagram+Snapchat+YouTube
 \nTikTok: photo-carousel inbox draft (lands ~2 h before the slot)\, then p
 ublish in the app.\nInstagram: hand-post the Reel from the kit.\nSnapchat:
  hand-post the Reel to Spotlight. 1) Download the 9:16 reel to your phone.
  2) Open Snapchat as @syzigyapp\, swipe up from the camera to open Memorie
 s\, then the Camera Roll tab\, and pick the video. 3) Tap Send To\, choose
  Spotlight\, paste the caption and hashtags\, then Post. Or on a computer:
  my.snapchat.com > Upload to Spotlight. Vertical video\, 60s or less. Capt
 ion is in the kit.\nYouTube Shorts: hand-post the same 9:16 reel from the 
 kit. Title and description are in the kit's YouTube Shorts section when El
 la has written a ### YouTube block\; otherwise copy is pending.\n\nKit: ht
 tps://syzigy-media.vijostudio.com/posts/gaming-squads/2026-11-23-friend-gr
 oup-games/kit/\nDashboard: https://syzigy-media.vijostudio.com/cal-tn3d5sy
